WEBVTT

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:32.586
of something that they felt
they were not quite yet.

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.896
AG: The bankers and consultants
were testing out

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.916
what she called "provisional selves,"

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.846
and it made some of them uncomfortable.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.487
HI: It was a real sense that,
"This isn't me.

00:15:41.511 --> 00:15:43.339
I can't see myself that way.

00:15:43.363 --> 00:15:45.907
I'm going to have to find
my own way through this."

00:15:45.931 --> 00:15:50.036
It was just really a major threat
to their sense of self.

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:52.326
AG: So they stuck to
their existing identities

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:54.868
instead of trying new styles
of self-presentation

00:15:54.892 --> 00:15:57.010
that felt unfamiliar to them.

00:15:57.034 --> 00:16:01.448
As a result, they often struggled
to adapt to and excel in their new roles.